    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ErufuAI</strong> is an intelligent AI nurturing virtual companion app designed to become an intimate partner to users through multimodal interactions and continuous learning. The app features powerful personalization capabilities, allowing it to understand users' preferences and needs while continuously evolving, providing deep emotional communication and interactive experiences. Users can engage in immersive interactions with virtual characters, enjoying highly realistic simulated scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trainable Personality</strong>: The AI companion can remember users' preferences and habits, becoming the partner who understands them best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multimodal Intelligence</strong>: Supports visual recognition, voice interaction,  offering an immersive chatting experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Voice Interaction</strong>: Low-latency, interruptible conversations create a more natural form of interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Flexibility</strong>: Supports customizable characters and voice cloning, catering to personalized needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ErufuAI's target audience is broad, including anime enthusiasts, otome game players, and tech product lovers. With rich application scenarios, users can enjoy personalized emotional companionship and interaction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ErufuAI</strong> is an intelligent AI nurturing virtual companion app designed to become an intimate partner to users through multimodal interactions and continuous learning. The app features powerful personalization capabilities, allowing it to understand users' preferences and needs while continuously evolving, providing deep emotional communication and interactive experiences. Users can engage in immersive interactions with virtual characters, enjoying highly realistic simulated scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trainable Personality</strong>: The AI companion can remember users' preferences and habits, becoming the partner who understands them best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multimodal Intelligence</strong>: Supports visual recognition, voice interaction,  offering an immersive chatting experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Voice Interaction</strong>: Low-latency, interruptible conversations create a more natural form of interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Flexibility</strong>: Supports customizable characters and voice cloning, catering to personalized needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ErufuAI's target audience is broad, including anime enthusiasts, otome game players, and tech product lovers. With rich application scenarios, users can enjoy personalized emotional companionship and interaction.</p>",
    "short_description": "ErufuAI is a smart virtual companion app that grows with users through interactive learning. It offers personalized experiences with features like custom Live2D models, character cards, and voice cloning.",
